3ac8f8c8-c0f5-46e4-86f5-3c554554e5c4.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723119/a9193bab-0518-4991-a2c5-f980a8f5fc08.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723119/a9193bab-0518-4991-a2c5-f980a8f5fc08.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723119/a9193bab-0518-4991-a2c5-f980a8f5fc08.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723119/a9193bab-0518-4991-a2c5-f980a8f5fc08.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723119/a9193bab-0518-4991-a2c5-f980a8f5fc08.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723119/a9193bab-0518-4991-a2c5-f980a8f5fc08.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"About this space\n\nEnjoy a relaxing stay in this bright and fully furnished apartment in the charming village of Egglfing am Inn, part of the renowned spa destination of Bad Füssing. Perfect for professionals, project workers, digital nomads, relocation guests and wellness visitors, the apartment offers a spacious living area, a fully equipped kitchen, dedicated workspace and a private balcony. With excellent public transport and road connections, you can easily reach Bad Füssing’s famous thermal spas while enjoying a peaceful residential setting.\n\n⸻\n\nThe space\n\nWelcome to your temporary home in the heart of Lower Bavaria.\n\nThis fully private apartment has been thoughtfully equipped for both short and extended stays, combining comfort, functionality and a quiet location.\n\nThe apartment features:\n\n• Entire apartment exclusively for your use\n• Comfortable double bed\n• Spacious living room\n• Fully equipped open-plan kitchen\n• Dedicated workspace for remote work\n• Private balcony\n• Modern bathroom with bathtub\n• High-speed Wi-Fi\n• Dining area\n• Ample wardrobe and storage space\n• Bright rooms with plenty of natural daylight\n\nWhether you’re travelling for work, a long-term project or simply planning a relaxing spa holiday, this apartment provides everything you need to feel at home.\n\n⸻\n\nLocation & Transport\n\nOne of the apartment’s biggest advantages is its excellent connectivity while being located in a quiet residential neighbourhood.\n\nPublic Transport\n\n• Egglfing, Pichlstraße bus stop — approximately 3 minutes’ walk\n• Regional Bus 7762 with direct connections to Bad Füssing and surrounding villages. The journey to the spa centre takes approximately 18–20 minutes.  \n\nBy Car\n\n• Bad Füssing Thermal Spa District — approx. 6 minutes\n• Bad Füssing town centre — approx. 6 minutes\n• Pocking — approx. 15 minutes\n• Passau — approx. 35 minutes\n• Austrian border (Obernberg am Inn) — approx. 5 minutes\n\n⸻\n\nNearby Highlights\n\nWithin only a few minutes you can reach many of the area’s most popular attractions:\n\n• Johannesbad Therme\n• Europa Therme\n• Therme Eins\n• Kurpark Bad Füssing\n• Bad Füssing Spa Promenade\n• Inn River cycling paths\n• Egglfing village centre\n• Restaurants, cafés and bakeries\n• Supermarkets and pharmacies\n• Walking and cycling routes along the River Inn\n\nThe surrounding area is well known for its wellness facilities, cycling routes, nature walks and excellent Bavarian and Austrian cuisine, making it an ideal destination for both business and leisure stays.\n\n⸻\n\nPlease note: The listing photos have been professionally edited to enhance brightness and presentation. The apartment’s