/housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723122/3faf31c4-bd4a-46b5-a4b5-7e51b7ffec10.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723122/3faf31c4-bd4a-46b5-a4b5-7e51b7ffec10.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1723122/3faf31c4-bd4a-46b5-a4b5-7e51b7ffec10.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"About this space\n\nEnjoy a relaxing stay in this spacious ground-floor apartment with a private garden in the charming village of Egglfing am Inn, part of the renowned spa destination of Bad Füssing. Featuring two comfortable bedrooms, dedicated workspaces, a fully equipped kitchen, and modern minimalist furnishings, the apartment is ideal for families, business travelers, digital nomads, project workers, and relocation guests. With excellent public transport and road connections, you can easily reach the famous thermal spas while enjoying a peaceful residential setting.\n\n⸻\n\nThe space\n\nWelcome to your home away from home.\n\nThis bright and generously sized apartment has been thoughtfully designed to provide comfort, functionality, and a relaxing atmosphere for both short and long-term stays.\n\nThe apartment offers:\n\n• Entire ground-floor apartment exclusively for your use\n• Master bedroom with a comfortable double bed\n• Second bedroom with a comfortable single bed\n• Dedicated workspaces in both bedrooms\n• Spacious living room with Smart TV and comfortable seating\n• Fully equipped kitchen with:\n\n* Oven\n* Dishwasher\n* Refrigerator\n* Washing machine\n* Coffee machine\n* Cooking utensils and dining essentials\n* Modern bathroom\n* Private garden with outdoor seating area\n* High-speed Wi-Fi\n* Bright rooms with plenty of natural daylight\n* Easy ground-floor access\n\nWhether you’re travelling for business, relocating, working remotely or planning a relaxing wellness holiday, this apartment offers the perfect combination of comfort and convenience.\n\n⸻\n\nLocation & Transport\n\nLocated in the quiet village of Egglfing am Inn, the apartment combines a peaceful residential environment with excellent access to the region’s most popular destinations.\n\nPublic Transport\n\nEgglfing, Egglfinger Hof Bus Stop\n• Approx. 3 minutes walking\n• Regional Bus 7762\n• Direct connection to Bad Füssing Thermal Spa Centre\n• Travel time: approximately 10–15 minutes\n\nEgglfing, Pichlstraße Bus Stop\n• Approx. 4 minutes walking\n• Regional Bus 7762\n• Direct connections throughout Bad Füssing and nearby villages.\n\nBy Car\n\n• Bad Füssing Town Centre — 6 minutes\n• Johannesbad Therme — 5 minutes\n• Europa Therme — 7 minutes\n• Therme Eins — 7 minutes\n• Kurpark Bad Füssing — 7 minutes\n• Pocking Train Station — 15 minutes\n• Passau — 35 minutes\n• Austrian Border (Obernberg am Inn) — 5 minutes\n\nThe apartment also offers easy access to the B12 and regional roads connecting Passau, Pocking and the Austrian border.\n\n⸻\n\nNearby Attractions\n\nEverything you need is within easy reach:\n\nWellness & Spa\n• Johannesbad Therme\n• Europa Therme\n• Therme Eins\n• Kurpark Bad Füssing\n• Saunahof Bad Füssing\n\nRestaurants & Cafés\n• Traditional Bavarian restaurants\n• Italian restaurants\n• Cafés and bakeries in Egglfing and Bad Füssing\n\nShopping\n• EDEKA supermarket\n• Netto Marken-Discount\n• Local bakeries\n• Pharmacies\n• Banks\n\nOutdoor Activities\n• Inn River cycling paths\n• Walking trails\n• Golfclub Bad Füssing-Kirchham\n• Tennis courts\n• Scenic nature walks along the River Inn\n\nThis location is particularly popular with business travelers, wellness guests, cyclists, and visitors looking for a quiet stay with excellent accessibility.\n\n⸻\n\nGuest access\n\nGuests enjoy exclusive access to the entire apartment, including:\n\n• Two private bedrooms\n• Spacious living room\n• Fully equipped kitchen\n• Bathroom\n• Private garden\n• Washing machine\n• High-speed Wi-Fi\n• Dedicated workspaces\n• Building entrance and common areas\n\nNo shared living spaces.\n\n⸻\n\nOther things to note\n\n• Entire private apartment\n• Ground-floor accommodation with private garden\n• Self check-in instructions provided before arrival\n• Ideal for families, business travelers, professionals, relocation guests and long-term stays\n• High-speed Wi-Fi suitable for remote work\n• Dedicated workspaces in both bedrooms\n• Excellent public transport with the Egglfing Egglfinger Hof bus stop only 3 minutes walking\n• Shops, cafés, restaurants and the thermal spas are only a few minutes away by bus, bicycle or car\n• Smoking is only permitted outdoors\n• Parties and events are not allowed\n• Please respect the neighbours and quiet hours during your stay\n\nPlease note: The listing photos have been professionally edited to enhance brightness and presentation. The apartment layout remains the same, while furniture, decoration and styling may vary slightly depending on availability.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"yes"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"70"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":180000,"deposit":360000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1800.00","deposit":"3600.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":6,"moveInWindow":30,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":18,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-08-27"}],"updated":"2026-08-27T11:12:54Z","__utId__":"ut1723122"}]